@startuml U17_task_for_a_person_state
!include style.iuml
title U17 — Task for a person (state machine, Sprint 4) · worklist + engine

[*] --> Open : TaskRequested.worklist\n/ due_at = request time + deadline
Open --> Claimed : claim (same role)
Claimed --> Open : release (by the claimant)
Claimed --> Done : complete [outputs valid]\n/ TaskCompleted
Open --> Open : TaskReassigned [level > current]\n/ role := next level, due_at reset
Claimed --> Open : TaskReassigned [level > current]\n/ unclaimed, role := next level
Open --> Cancelled : CancelRequested\nor case failed / compensated
Claimed --> Cancelled : CancelRequested\nor case failed / compensated
Done --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
note right of Open
  Escalation (ENG-06), driven by engine timers:
  deadline → level 1 role (e.g. charge_nurse);
  each level's afterMin → next level;
  after the last level → NotificationRequested to manager.
end note
note bottom of Done
  Undo tasks (kind = undo, ENG-08) follow the same
  states but answer Compensated instead of TaskCompleted.
end note
@enduml
